    "idea": "<p>两个数组：<code>dist</code> 初始化成一个极大值（比如 <code>10**18</code>），起点写 0；<code>used</code> 记哪些点已经定下来。</p><p>重复 n 轮：每轮在没定下来的点里找 <code>dist</code> 最小的那个 u，把它标记定下来，再用 u 松弛它的所有邻居（<code>dist[u] + w &lt; dist[v]</code> 才改）。扫一遍最小值是 O(n)，一共 O(n^2)，一百五十个点很轻松。</p><p>如果整轮都没点可定，直接 break。输出时 <code>dist</code> 还是那个极大值的点就是到不了，要写成 -1，把极大值原样打出来是最常见的错。</p>",
    "code": "\"\"\"p75 小镇观光（Dijkstra 入门）：n 个点、m 条双向道路，长度都非负，\n从 s 出发，按编号 1 到 n 输出到每个点的最短距离，到不了输出 -1。\n这里用每轮线性扫一遍找最小距离的朴素写法，复杂度 O(n^2)，点少的时候完全够用。\n再用小根堆优化的写法算一遍，两边必须一致。\n\"\"\"\nimport heapq\nimport sys\n\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    n, m, s = int(data[0]), int(data[1]), int(data[2])\n    adj = [[] for _ in range(n + 1)]\n    pos = 3\n    for _ in range(m):\n        u, v, w = int(data[pos]), int(data[pos + 1]), int(data[pos + 2])\n        pos += 3\n        adj[u].append((v, w))         # 双向道路\n        adj[v].append((u, w))\n    assert pos == len(data), \"边数对不上\"\n\n    big = 10 ** 18\n    INF = big\n    dist = [INF] * (n + 1)\n    used = [False] * (n + 1)\n    dist[s] = 0\n    for _ in range(n):                # 每轮定下一个最远的点\n        u = 0\n        best = INF\n        for i in range(1, n + 1):     # 线性扫最小值，朴素版就是这么慢\n            if not used[i] and dist[i] < best:\n                best = dist[i]\n                u = i\n        if u == 0:\n            break                     # 剩下的点都到不了\n        used[u] = True\n        for v, w in adj[u]:\n            if dist[u] + w < dist[v]:\n                dist[v] = dist[u] + w\n\n    heap_dist = [INF] * (n + 1)       # 堆优化版，拿来核对\n    heap_dist[s] = 0\n    heap = [(0, s)]\n    while heap:\n        d, u = heapq.heappop(heap)\n        if d > heap_dist[u]:\n            continue                  # 堆里留下的旧记录，跳过\n        for v, w in adj[u]:\n            if d + w < heap_dist[v]:\n                heap_dist[v] = d + w\n                heapq.heappush(heap, (heap_dist[v], v))\n\n    assert dist == heap_dist, \"朴素 Dijkstra 与堆优化不一致\"\n    out = []\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        out.append(str(dist[i] if dist[i] < big else -1))\n    sys.stdout.write(\"\\n\".join(out) + \"\\n\")\n\n\nmain()\n",
    "output": "$ python p75_dijkstra_small.py\n输入：4 4 1\n1 2 3\n2 3 4\n1 3 10\n3 4 1\n\n输出：0\r\n3\r\n7\r\n8\r\n",
    "reference": "code/ch10-graph/09_dijkstra_naive.py"
  }
}